The after-hours frequency reduction of the after-hours remote amount of a ClearPath Managed IT Services ticket counts the agreement's resolved tickets of labor class remote after-hours and labor route invoice in the last 6 months (a month window ending today, this ticket included):
- 3 or more take 5.0 percent off;
- exactly 2 take 2.5 percent off;
- one takes nothing off.

A whole month between two dates is counted only once the later date reaches the same day of the month as the earlier one, and a month window of N months ending today takes the entries dated fewer than N whole months before today. Tickets are counted by the moment of their resolution in the agreement's ticket history.

**Hypothetical cases, today 2025-11-20.** Invoiced remote after-hours resolutions on 2025-06-02, 2025-09-14 and 2025-11-18: three, 5.0 percent off. Resolutions on 2025-05-20 and 2025-11-18: the first is 6 whole months old and outside the window, leaving one, so nothing is taken off. Resolutions on 2025-07-01 and 2025-11-18: two, 2.5 percent off.
